[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593794861","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561#issuecomment-2593794861","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","id":2593794861,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6amist","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T19:44:22Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T19:44:22Z","body":"In the XML docs, I had to mix tabs & spaces instead of only tabs so that the code would be properly indented in Godot.\r\n\r\nIf I used pure tabs, the doctool would undo the indentation, showing this:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nrd = RenderingServer.get_rendering_device()\r\n\r\nif rd.has_feature(RenderingDevice.SUPPORTS_BUFFER_DEVICE_ADDRESS):\r\nstorage_buffer = rd.storage_buffer_create(bytes.size(), bytes, RenderingDevice.STORAGE_BUFFER_USAGE_SHADER_DEVICE_ADDRESS):\r\nstorage_buffer_address = rd.buffer_get_device_address(storage_buffer)\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nInstead of this:\r\n```gdscript\r\nrd = RenderingServer.get_rendering_device()\r\n\r\nif rd.has_feature(RenderingDevice.SUPPORTS_BUFFER_DEVICE_ADDRESS):\r\n\t  storage_buffer = rd.storage_buffer_create(bytes.size(), bytes, RenderingDevice.STORAGE_BUFFER_USAGE_SHADER_DEVICE_ADDRESS):\r\n\t  storage_buffer_address = rd.buffer_get_device_address(storage_buffer)\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6a08d270-2ffd-4cec-a29f-f2bf006663da)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593794861/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593882723","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561#issuecomment-2593882723","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","id":2593882723,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6am4Jj","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T20:36:09Z","updated_at":"2025-01-15T20:36:09Z","body":"> In the XML docs, I had to mix tabs & spaces instead of only tabs so that the code would be properly indented in Godot.\r\n\r\nThat's by design (for now). The XML structure should be indented with tabs, and code in codeblocks should be indented with 4 spaces. They're two different contexts using a different indent convention, albeit an arguably weird one.\r\n\r\nWe'll probably change this with #89819 but for now you need to follow the current convention.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2593882723/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634395757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561#issuecomment-2634395757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","id":2634395757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dBbBt","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T15:57:23Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T15:57:23Z","body":"You mean BUFFER_CREATION_DEVICE_ADDRESS_**BIT** should be BUFFER_CREATION_DEVICE_ADDRESS_**FLAG** and BufferCreation**Bits** should be BufferCreation**Flags** ?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634395757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634483676","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561#issuecomment-2634483676","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","id":2634483676,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dBwfc","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T16:30:19Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T16:30:27Z","body":"> You mean BUFFER_CREATION_DEVICE_ADDRESS_**BIT** should be BUFFER_CREATION_DEVICE_ADDRESS_**FLAG** and BufferCreation**Bits** should be BufferCreation**Flags** ?\r\n\r\nOnly the latter change, you shouldn't need to specify _BIT or _FLAG on the enum itself.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634483676/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634635977","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561#issuecomment-2634635977","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","id":2634635977,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dCVrJ","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-04T17:35:15Z","updated_at":"2025-02-04T17:35:15Z","body":"> Only the latter change, you shouldn't need to specify _BIT or _FLAG on the enum itself.\r\n\r\nWait. I'm confused. A lot of other code in the codebase uses that convention. e.g.\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nenum TextureAspectBits {\r\n\tTEXTURE_ASPECT_COLOR_BIT = (1 << TEXTURE_ASPECT_COLOR),\r\n\tTEXTURE_ASPECT_DEPTH_BIT = (1 << TEXTURE_ASPECT_DEPTH),\r\n\tTEXTURE_ASPECT_STENCIL_BIT = (1 << TEXTURE_ASPECT_STENCIL),\r\n};\r\n\r\nenum PipelineStageBits {\r\n\tPIPELINE_STAGE_TOP_OF_PIPE_BIT = (1 << 0),\r\n\tPIPELINE_STAGE_DRAW_INDIRECT_BIT = (1 << 1),\r\n\t// ...\r\n};\r\n\r\nenum BarrierAccessBits {\r\n\tBARRIER_ACCESS_INDIRECT_COMMAND_READ_BIT = (1 << 0),\r\n\tBARRIER_ACCESS_INDEX_READ_BIT = (1 << 1),\r\n\t// ...\r\n};\r\n\r\nenum WindowFlagsBit {\r\n\tWINDOW_FLAG_RESIZE_DISABLED_BIT = (1 << WINDOW_FLAG_RESIZE_DISABLED),\r\n\tWINDOW_FLAG_BORDERLESS_BIT = (1 << WINDOW_FLAG_BORDERLESS),\r\n\t// ...\r\n};\r\n```\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2634635977/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637383011","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561#issuecomment-2637383011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","id":2637383011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dM0Vj","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T16:13:46Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T16:13:54Z","body":"It seems the usage is currently inconsistent between `Flags` vs `Bits` suffix for the enum, and `_BIT` or nothing for the actual flags. So I'd just align with whatever seems to be used in this class / related classes. From the above there seems to be a fair _bit_ of `Bits`/`_BIT` in rendering.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637383011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2652236115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101561#issuecomment-2652236115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101561","id":2652236115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eFelT","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","use